ate the devs are going. \n\nSome people may complain about consistency, but it shows you how competent these devs are at pushing out content.\n\nYou can play the whole game without spending a dime, and at the same time, there is no problem putting money in microstransactions if you feel like it.\n\nGameplay is solid and progression is glorious.\n\nPvp is something people rarely touch for a good reason and i think the devs should fix that", "timestamp_created": 1500852063, "timestamp_updated": 1500852063, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "33753973", "author": {"steamid": "76561198355894789", "personaname": "Grandpa", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/MLGrandpa/", "num_games_owned": 914, "num_reviews": 118, "playtime_forever": 38633, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 25927, "last_played": 1765442087, "avatar": "9cf6bd402a62e7ac37c83e43d2b0615062e1ba86"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's good, but time consuming. I'd only recommend it if you like grinding and collecting and don't listen to people who say its pay to win you can get absolutely get anything if you just put in the time and effort", "timestamp_created": 1500847661, "timestamp_updated": 1572660900, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "33753687", "author": {"steamid": "76561198097565034", "personaname": "Såspäron", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Sosparon/", 